        "f1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need my phone, an app, or Wi-Fi?",
            "answer": "<p>Nope, none of it. Everything's controlled right from the handheld remote. No app, no WiFi, no monthly fees, ever.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What happens when my dog reaches the boundary?",
            "answer": "<p>A gentle beep first, then a vibration, then optional static, all adjustable 0–9 and each one can be turned fully off. Most dogs learn the line in a few days.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it just a fence, or can I train with it too?",
            "answer": "<p>Both. Set the GPS boundary at home, then grab the remote to correct your dog anywhere, up to 1,650 ft away. A fence and a trainer in one collar.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will it fit my dog?",
            "answer": "<p>Fits dogs 10–200 lbs with 10–30 inch necks, fully adjustable strap. Big, small, and every escape artist in between.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if it doesn't work for my dog?",
            "answer": "<p>You're covered by our 90-day guarantee. Give it a real shot, and if your dog still isn't staying put, we'll make it right.</p>"
